	<title>#9 &#8211; Nathan Jones: Athletic Trainer, UVA, Ferrum, CCHS, Books, Sports, Running, Advice</title>
	<link>https://theridgepodcast.com/podcast/9-nathan-jones-athletic-trainer-uva-ferrum-cchs-books-sports-running-advice/</link>
