<item>
	<title>#8 &#8211; Delegate Wren Williams: Politics, Patrick County, Republican, law school, lawyer, faith, husband, technology</title>
	<link>https://theridgepodcast.com/podcast/8-delegate-wren-williams-politics-patrick-county-republican-law-school-lawyer-faith-husband-technology/</link>
	<pubDate>Wed, 19 Apr 2023 11:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
	<dc:creator><![CDATA[The Ridge Podcast]]></dc:creator>
	<guid isPermaLink="false">https://theridgepodcast.com/?post_type=podcast&#038;p=110</guid>
	<description><![CDATA[<p>In this episode, Jeffrey (Luke) Watson and Ethan Edwards interview Delegate Wren Williams (VA, HD-9). They ask about how he got into politics just a few years ago, his time and accomplishments serving as a state representative in Virginia, and his personal life as a new father, husband, and owner of a small business, a local law firm.</p>



<p>Thank you again Delegate Williams for being on the podcast.</p>



